tems:\n\n#### audio: Reference audio for the first person\n\n#### text: Text input\n\n#### dialogue_audio_s2: Reference audio for the second person\n\n#### emo_audio_prompt: Emotional reference audio for the first person\n\n#### emo_audio_prompt_s2: Emotional reference audio for the second person\n\n-------------------\n\n#### top_k: Number of samples to extract from the audio. top_p: Select 80% of the extracted samples to further stabilize the timbre.\n\n#### temperature: Temperature, the degree of pitch variation; can be increased appropriately. num_beams: 3. Default is fine.\n\n#### max_mel_tokens: Number of characters.\n\n#### deepspeed: Must be enabled. Whether to enable deepspeed acceleration.\n\n#### unload_model: Whether to unload the model.\n\n#### emo_alpha: Emotional intensity of the first person speaking.\n\n#### emo_vector: The first speaker's emotional control is supported. Input a list in English format like [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.45, 0] (each intensity ranges from 0 to 1, representing a surprise intensity of 0.45). The numbers correspond to: [happiness, anger, sadness, fear, hatred, depression, surprise, neutral]. Combinations are virtually unlimited.\n\n#### use_emo_text: The first speaker's emotional control. If using emo_text, the emotional control is based on the audio. Text control is not recommended.\n\n---------------------\n\n### The following parameters are for the second speaker. They are the same as the first speaker's parameters."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "参数详解", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [528.1822509765625, 697.8163452148438], "pos": [3130.444091796875, 362.0886535644531], "id": 165, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["# IndexTTS2 Run Parameter Details\n\n## Port Input Items:\n\n#### audio: Reference audio for the first person\n\n#### text: Text input\n\n#### dialogue_audio_s2: Reference audio for the second person\n\n#### emo_audio_prompt: Emotional reference audio for the first person\n\n#### emo_audio_prompt_s2: Emotional reference audio for the second person\n\n-------------------\n\n#### top_k: Number of samples to extract from the audio. top_p: Select 80% of the extracted samples to further stabilize the timbre.\n\n#### temperature: Temperature, the degree of pitch variation; can be increased appropriately. num_beams: 3. Default is fine.\n\n#### max_mel_tokens: Number of characters.\n\n#### deepspeed: Must be enabled. Whether to enable deepspeed acceleration.\n\n#### unload_model: Whether to unload the model.\n\n#### emo_alpha: Emotional intensity of the first person speaking.\n\n#### emo_vector: The first speaker's emotional control is supported. Input a list in English format like [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.45, 0] (each intensity ranges from 0 to 1, representing a surprise intensity of 0.45). The numbers correspond to: [happiness, anger, sadness, fear, hatred, depression, surprise, neutral]. Combinations are virtually unlimited.\n\n#### use_emo_text: The first speaker's emotional control. If using emo_text, the emotional control is based on the audio. Text control is not recommended.\n\n---------------------\n\n### The following parameters are for the second speaker. They are the same as the first speaker's parameters."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "参数详解", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [528.1822509765625, 697.8163452148438], "pos": [2936.101806640625, -811.4747924804688], "id": 170, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [122], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [315, 136], "pos": [1167.462646484375, -844.8561401367188], "widgets_values": ["7e4ad7b6fdb1be484b67c50e772607452715b202c2b8f1709a62272780bbfc86